---
import JournalHeading from './JournalHeading.astro';
import ThemeChoice from './ThemeChoice.astro';
---
<template id="agenda-template">
  <section class="page-frame">
    <JournalHeading section="agenda" title="Agenda"><button class="primary" data-add>Tambah agenda</button></JournalHeading>
    <div class="planner-columns">
      <div class="sheet timeline">
        <details class="reminder-settings" data-system-settings>
          <summary>Atur pengingat</summary>
          <div class="reminder-content">
            <p role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
            <div class="agenda-actions">
              <button type="button" data-enable>Aktifkan notifikasi browser</button>
              <button type="button" data-test>Coba notifikasi</button>
            </div>
            <p>Notifikasi Mimi berjalan selama web terbuka. Untuk pengingat saat web ditutup, buka agenda mendatang dan pilih “Ingatkan lewat kalender HP”.</p>
          </div>
        </details>
        <div data-schedule></div>
      </div>
      <aside class="sheet import-calendar"><h2>Kalender lain</h2><div data-calendar-import></div></aside>
    </div>
  </section>
</template>
<template id="profile-template">
  <section class="page-frame">
    <JournalHeading section="profile" title="Profil Iqlima" />
    <div class="planner-columns">
      <section class="sheet preferences">
        <h2>Ruang pribadimu</h2>
        <ThemeChoice />
        <fieldset class="theme-choice manja-choice">
          <legend>Mimi manja</legend>
          <label class="theme-row">
            Mimi nyapa sesuai jam, ikut seneng, dan minta dielus
            <input type="checkbox" role="switch" data-manja-switch />
          </label>
          <p>Kalau dimatikan, Mimi tetap kasih kabar simpan dan pengingat dengan kalimat biasa.</p>
        </fieldset>
        <div class="profile-reminder">
          <h3>Pengingat Mimi</h3>
          <p>Titipanmu tersimpan di browser ini. Coba lihat pengingat yang akan muncul di halamanmu.</p>
          <button type="button" data-test-popup>Coba pop-up Mimi</button>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="sheet care-settings" data-care-section>
        <h2>Jaga diri & orang tersayang</h2>
        <p>Pengingat lembut muncul saat Titip Mimi terbuka. Matikan yang nggak perlu.</p>
        <fieldset class="theme-choice"><legend>Pengingat jaga diri</legend><div data-care-list></div></fieldset>
        <label>Nomor WhatsApp Jundy<input data-wa inputmode="tel" autocomplete="off" placeholder="08xx xxxx xxxx" maxlength="20" /></label>
        <label>Instagram Jundy<input data-ig autocomplete="off" placeholder="@username" maxlength="40" /></label>
        <label>Ulang tahun Iqlima<input type="date" data-birthday /></label>
      </section>
      <section class="sheet connections"><h2>Koneksi Mimi</h2>
        <div data-account>
          <h3>Akun Titip Mimi</h3>
          <p data-account-status role="status"></p>
          <div data-google-button></div>
          <div data-migrate hidden>
            <p data-migrate-text></p>
            <button type="button" class="primary" data-migrate-yes>Pindahkan titipan</button>
            <button type="button" class="quiet" data-migrate-later>Nanti saja</button>
          </div>
          <button type="button" class="quiet" data-logout hidden>Keluar</button>
        </div>
        <div><h3>Google Kalender</h3><p>Ambil agenda dari file kalender, atau kirim satu agenda ke Google Kalender.</p><button data-open-agenda>Buka Agenda</button></div>
        <div data-telegram>
          <h3>Telegram</h3>
          <p data-telegram-status role="status"></p>
          <button type="button" class="primary" data-telegram-link hidden>Hubungkan Telegram</button>
          <fieldset class="theme-choice telegram-quiet" data-telegram-quiet hidden>
            <legend>Jam tenang</legend>
            <p>Pengingat di jam ini Mimi tahan sampai jam tenang selesai.</p>
            <div class="quiet-times">
              <label>Mulai<input type="time" data-quiet-start /></label>
              <label>Sampai<input type="time" data-quiet-end /></label>
            </div>
            <label class="quiet-off"><input type="checkbox" data-quiet-off /> Matikan jam tenang</label>
          </fieldset>
          <button type="button" class="quiet" data-telegram-unlink hidden>Putuskan Telegram</button>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </section>
</template>
